    <text>
        <body>
            <div type="edition" xml:lang="lzh" xml:space="preserve">
<ab>
<lb n="1"/><persName>佛</persName>言：佛告
<lb n="T08n0232_0728a26"/>復次<persName>“舍利弗</persName>，汝問云何名
<lb n="2"/>佛，云何觀佛者。不
<lb n="T08n0232_0728a27"/>生、不滅，
<lb n="3"/>不来、不去，非名 、非相，是名
<lb n="4"/>為佛。如自
<lb n="T08n0232_0728a28"/>觀身實相，觀佛
<lb n="5"/><supplied reason="lost">亦</supplied>然。唯有智者，乃能知耳。
<lb n="6"/>是
<lb n="T08n0232_0728a29"/>名觀佛。”
</ab>
            </div>
            <div type="apparatus"/>
            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en">
                <p>The Buddha said: “ Śāriputra , you ask, what is it that is named the Buddha? How does one contemplate the Buddha? Not produced, not extinguished; not come, not gone; not a name, not an attribute—this is called the Buddha. As one contemplates the real attributes of one’s body, just so one contemplates the Buddha. Only those with wisdom can understand this. This is named contemplating the Buddha.”</p>
            </div>
        </body>
